{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24111","headline":"夏日作 · 白居易","name":"夏日作","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"葛衣疎且单，纱帽轻复宽。\n一衣与一帽，可以过炎天。\n止於便吾体，何必被罗纨。\n宿雨林笋嫩，晨露园葵鲜。\n烹葵炮嫩笋，可以备朝餐。\n止於适吾口，何必饫腥羶。\n饭讫盥漱已，扪腹方果然。\n婆娑庭前步，安稳窗下眠。\n外养物不费，内归心不烦。\n不费用难尽，不烦神易安。\n庶几无夭阏，得以终天年。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24111.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24111","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}